WEBVTT

00:00:11.011 --> 00:00:13.639
-[men screaming]
-[horses neighing]

00:00:17.726 --> 00:00:20.437
[horses galloping]

00:00:25.734 --> 00:00:28.445
[swords clashing]

00:00:33.742 --> 00:00:36.036
[men yelling]

00:00:40.791 --> 00:00:44.377
My Lady, they are upon us.

00:00:44.461 --> 00:00:47.798
The Khan has come.
Run for the desert.

00:01:12.698 --> 00:01:14.241
Lady Kokachin.

00:01:23.291 --> 00:01:26.044
You're protected by your blood.
They will not harm you.

00:01:26.128 --> 00:01:29.256
Harm me? No.

00:01:29.339 --> 00:01:32.801
Take me into Kublai's harem? Yes.

00:01:36.346 --> 00:01:38.056
Is it not better than death?

00:01:38.140 --> 00:01:39.599
No, Nergüi...

00:01:42.060 --> 00:01:46.523
to live under the yoke of a Khan
is not better than the Eternal Blue.

00:01:46.606 --> 00:01:47.650
[gasps]

00:01:47.733 --> 00:01:49.026
[gasps]

00:01:51.779 --> 00:01:53.280
Lady Kokachin!

00:01:53.363 --> 00:01:54.572
[sobbing]

00:02:11.131 --> 00:02:13.133
[theme music playing]

00:03:45.976 --> 00:03:48.186
Do we have to attend?

00:03:48.270 --> 00:03:50.397
Your absence would be noted.

00:03:51.689 --> 00:03:53.191
Khutulun...

00:03:53.275 --> 00:03:55.110
that wrestling whore from the west.

00:03:55.193 --> 00:04:01.408
Please expel any of your contempt within
the confines of these walls, Princess.

00:04:01.491 --> 00:04:02.700
Why is she coming here?

00:04:02.785 --> 00:04:04.995
I do not know
and it does not matter.

00:04:05.078 --> 00:04:07.915
You will conduct yourself
as you always do...

00:04:07.998 --> 00:04:10.458
with graciousness.

00:04:12.169 --> 00:04:15.255
You may have more in common
than you imagine.

00:04:16.173 --> 00:04:17.758
That's doubtful.

00:04:17.841 --> 00:04:19.051
[clicks tongue]

00:04:19.134 --> 00:04:21.929
You lost another trinket.

00:04:23.806 --> 00:04:25.723
A bracelet.

00:04:25.808 --> 00:04:27.768
It slipped off my wrist as I rode.

00:04:29.519 --> 00:04:31.646
A poor decision
to wear it on my whip hand.

00:04:31.729 --> 00:04:34.607
Yes, a poor decision.

00:04:36.026 --> 00:04:40.530
You take great risk to avoid
a greater danger, I understand.

00:04:41.114 --> 00:04:43.658
In celebration
of this New Year...

00:04:43.741 --> 00:04:47.204
perhaps you would allow me
to eliminate this danger...

00:04:48.621 --> 00:04:51.333
with my sword.

00:04:51.416 --> 00:04:53.001
I do not.

00:05:14.564 --> 00:05:15.899
Father.

00:05:19.069 --> 00:05:24.782
An auspicious day for departure.
<i>Tsagaan Sar.</i>

00:05:30.455 --> 00:05:33.041
What you did saved our lives.

00:05:33.125 --> 00:05:36.169
I know this.

00:05:36.253 --> 00:05:37.712
Your uncle knows, too...

00:05:39.006 --> 00:05:41.341
but will not confess it.

00:05:43.218 --> 00:05:44.802
I fear...

00:05:44.887 --> 00:05:48.431
I will require another New Year
to repay the debt I owe.

00:05:48.515 --> 00:05:51.351
The Khan will never allow you
back into the Imperial City.

00:05:53.395 --> 00:05:56.773
We will meet again.

00:06:00.277 --> 00:06:01.653
[grunts]

00:06:03.196 --> 00:06:06.950
Rot here, nephew...
with your devils.

00:06:07.034 --> 00:06:09.827
We go to the Silk Road to die.

00:06:16.418 --> 00:06:19.254
[Byamba] The brothers Polo
have lost their golden tablet.

00:06:19.337 --> 00:06:20.713
Yes.

00:06:20.797 --> 00:06:22.840
Imperial pass rescinded.

00:06:22.925 --> 00:06:24.592
I know.

00:06:24.676 --> 00:06:27.845
No lodging, no fresh horses,
no vittles.

00:06:27.930 --> 00:06:31.058
-They are vulnerable now to bandits.
-Byamba, I know.

00:06:31.141 --> 00:06:33.518
It's nothing they do not deserve.

00:06:35.562 --> 00:06:36.896
[Byamba]
We should go.

00:06:36.980 --> 00:06:40.317
The Great Khan will be expecting
an answer before the White Moon.

00:06:40.400 --> 00:06:43.528
-We must offer him a head.
-We must offer him the right head.

00:06:50.660 --> 00:06:52.037
[Khutulun] Polo!

00:06:56.458 --> 00:07:00.670
Did you come to greet me?
I'm touched.

00:07:00.753 --> 00:07:02.172
Did you miss Khutulun?

00:07:02.255 --> 00:07:05.008
The sun felt warmer
on my face this morning.

00:07:05.092 --> 00:07:06.426
Now I know why.

00:07:08.303 --> 00:07:10.805
I'm to present myself
to the Great Khan.

00:07:10.888 --> 00:07:12.182
Come, witness the pomp.

00:07:12.265 --> 00:07:14.142
We are called to duty, Lady.

00:07:14.226 --> 00:07:15.227
Come.

00:07:15.310 --> 00:07:18.855
Escort me or I will
tell the Khan of your disrespect.

00:07:41.753 --> 00:07:44.422
Plans been finalized
for the festival?

00:07:44.506 --> 00:07:46.967
They have.
The games will commence.

00:07:47.050 --> 00:07:48.343
Good.

00:07:53.181 --> 00:07:54.641
Hmm?

00:07:54.724 --> 00:07:56.893
The Latin's mission to Kochkor...

00:07:56.977 --> 00:07:59.521
I sent him.
I would like a report.

00:08:00.272 --> 00:08:03.066
Did he return
with a discovery?

00:08:03.150 --> 00:08:05.527
He and your brother
learned as much on their trek

00:08:05.610 --> 00:08:09.614
as Yusuf did flaying the skin
off the assassin's bones.

00:08:09.697 --> 00:08:12.409
-And that is all?
-That is all.

00:08:13.951 --> 00:08:15.828
Khutulun awaits your audience.

00:08:15.912 --> 00:08:19.416
Hmm. She dressed as
a warrior or a lady?

00:08:19.499 --> 00:08:20.708
The former.

00:08:20.792 --> 00:08:22.085
[Kublai laughs]

00:08:22.169 --> 00:08:23.545
I love that girl.

00:08:23.628 --> 00:08:26.548
[grunts]
No, no, no, no.

00:08:32.387 --> 00:08:36.141
-Are you aggrieved, Jingim?
-I am fine, Mother.

00:08:36.224 --> 00:08:38.185
Then be fine.

00:08:40.395 --> 00:08:43.648
Spirits high for our Khan
and our kingdom.

00:08:43.731 --> 00:08:46.984
Let us find resolution
before the White Moon.

00:08:51.573 --> 00:08:53.450
I come here, Khagan...

00:08:53.533 --> 00:08:57.162
as emissary for my father,
Kaidu of Karakorum.

00:08:57.245 --> 00:08:59.872
You are welcome,
Khutulun. Rise.

00:09:03.085 --> 00:09:05.628
Sire... we were pained to hear

00:09:05.712 --> 00:09:08.590
of the cowardly assault
on the Great Khan's person.

00:09:08.673 --> 00:09:12.469
It is my father's request
and my wish...

00:09:12.552 --> 00:09:14.637
that I remain with my horsemen
in Cambulac

00:09:14.721 --> 00:09:16.848
as protector of the Great Khan.

00:09:18.808 --> 00:09:22.520
Kaidu seeks to ensure your safety.

00:09:22.604 --> 00:09:25.232
I'm your servant.

00:09:25.315 --> 00:09:27.734
[Kublai] I have ample protection.

00:09:27.817 --> 00:09:29.902
But I welcome your presence.

00:09:29.986 --> 00:09:34.532
I accept your horse,
your sword, your spirit.

00:09:34.616 --> 00:09:35.742
You are home.

00:09:35.825 --> 00:09:39.121
We're deeply honored, my child.

00:09:39.204 --> 00:09:40.622
I invite you to rest...

00:09:40.705 --> 00:09:42.874
then join me
and the ladies of the court.

00:09:42.957 --> 00:09:45.835
I require no rest, Lady Chabi.

00:09:45.918 --> 00:09:47.795
Lead and I will follow.

00:09:49.046 --> 00:09:50.757
[both laughing]

00:09:51.758 --> 00:09:52.967
We tour Cambulac

00:09:53.050 --> 00:09:56.179
in preparation for
the Festival of the White Moon.

00:09:58.723 --> 00:10:01.393
You will accompany us.

00:10:01.476 --> 00:10:04.979
I am...
deeply honored.

00:10:23.331 --> 00:10:25.583
A word with you,
Blue Princess.

00:10:32.089 --> 00:10:34.217
Why did you not listen to me?

00:10:34.301 --> 00:10:36.594
Why did you not
run from this place?

00:10:36.678 --> 00:10:40.223
I want to know why you
ride the grasslands alone at night.

00:10:40.307 --> 00:10:43.601
I want to know who you
leave the stones for and why.

00:10:43.685 --> 00:10:45.520
That is none of your concern.

00:10:47.772 --> 00:10:50.275
I cannot protect you
if you do not talk to me.

00:10:51.734 --> 00:10:53.570
[sighs]

00:10:53.653 --> 00:10:56.030
Marco... I planted the serpent.

00:10:57.865 --> 00:10:59.909
I did not know it was you.

00:11:01.911 --> 00:11:04.456
I fear discovery.

00:11:04.539 --> 00:11:05.623
Of what?

00:11:05.707 --> 00:11:09.126
Tulga...
the man you confronted.

00:11:09.211 --> 00:11:10.837
He is a survivor of the Bayaut.

00:11:12.714 --> 00:11:14.966
-He's your subject?
-Was.

00:11:15.049 --> 00:11:18.135
-Does Za Bing know?
-That is why he allows my rides.

00:11:18.220 --> 00:11:19.887
And abdicates his duty.

00:11:19.971 --> 00:11:22.349
I forbid him from handling the gems.

00:11:22.432 --> 00:11:25.184
I will not compromise my friend.

00:11:27.354 --> 00:11:30.022
I will carry the gems
from now on.

00:11:30.106 --> 00:11:33.860
You wish not to
compromise your friend?

00:11:33.943 --> 00:11:37.447
Imagine what would happen to him
should you go missing now.

00:12:15.192 --> 00:12:17.570
[Jingim] Good New Year to you, brother.

00:12:17.654 --> 00:12:20.990
[Byamba] I worry when you call me
"brother" instead of "bastard."

00:12:21.073 --> 00:12:24.076
-It precedes a request.
-[Jingim chuckles]

00:12:24.160 --> 00:12:25.912
I need not request.

00:12:25.995 --> 00:12:27.079
I order.

00:12:27.497 --> 00:12:30.041
I await your command,
Jingim Khan.

00:12:32.419 --> 00:12:34.296
What news from
Eagle's Teaching?

00:12:34.379 --> 00:12:37.173
-[sighs] None to speak of.
-None...

00:12:37.256 --> 00:12:38.841
or none you will speak of?

00:12:39.884 --> 00:12:40.885
None.

00:12:40.968 --> 00:12:44.013
We're talking about my father.

00:12:44.096 --> 00:12:45.932
I will know what danger he faces.

00:12:46.015 --> 00:12:47.934
[Byamba] Our father.

00:12:48.017 --> 00:12:50.853
I share news of danger
with him alone.

00:12:50.937 --> 00:12:52.063
I disclose to the Khan.

00:12:52.146 --> 00:12:54.065
It is for the Khan
to report to the Prince.

00:12:54.148 --> 00:12:56.318
That is the order of things.

00:12:56.401 --> 00:12:59.278
You want to know about Eagle's Teaching,
ask Father, brother.

00:12:59.362 --> 00:13:02.740
If you know something...
the burden is on you to defend him.

00:13:02.824 --> 00:13:05.117
And I will... with my life.

00:13:05.201 --> 00:13:09.622
And if something happens to our father...
I will be the one to take it.

00:13:17.339 --> 00:13:19.131
What did Jingim want of you?

00:13:19.215 --> 00:13:22.469
Amends made
before the White Moon.

00:13:43.698 --> 00:13:46.826
There are no answers here,
Byamba, only pain.

00:13:46.909 --> 00:13:49.621
The most important answer may lie within.

00:13:49.704 --> 00:13:53.416
We must confirm it
to understand our next steps.

00:13:53.500 --> 00:13:56.335
[Marco]
Sanga's family has lost everything.

00:13:56.419 --> 00:13:58.546
Get-- Get--

00:13:58.630 --> 00:14:02.384
[Goland speaking Mandarin]

00:14:10.892 --> 00:14:12.727
Stay if you wish.

00:14:16.022 --> 00:14:18.483
[boy speaking Mandarin]

00:14:18.566 --> 00:14:20.192
[knocking on door]

00:14:23.696 --> 00:14:25.114
[boy greeting in Mandarin]
[Marco speaking Mandarin]

00:14:26.366 --> 00:14:28.117
[speaking English]
Can I see your mother?

00:14:36.042 --> 00:14:37.084
[spits]

00:14:37.168 --> 00:14:39.211
[Goland speaking English]
White devil.

00:14:39.295 --> 00:14:42.549
Urla, come!
Take the children.

00:14:48.930 --> 00:14:50.890
[boy speaking Mandarin]

00:14:52.016 --> 00:14:53.393
My condolences.

00:14:53.476 --> 00:14:55.019
[Goland] Forty days, Latin.

00:14:55.102 --> 00:14:57.313
Forty days is
the mourning period.

00:14:57.397 --> 00:14:59.148
Too late.

00:14:59.231 --> 00:15:01.651
I was away at war.

00:15:01.734 --> 00:15:03.820
That was some time ago,
Master Polo.

00:15:03.903 --> 00:15:05.863
Find a better reason
for your absence.

00:15:06.864 --> 00:15:08.783
[Marco] I have none.

00:15:10.577 --> 00:15:14.581
Goland, I'm sorry for
what happened to Sanga.

00:15:14.664 --> 00:15:18.710
More sorry for
what I'm about to ask.

00:15:18.793 --> 00:15:21.754
Did Sanga ever travel to Kochkor?

00:15:21.838 --> 00:15:24.924
[Goland] Do you suspect a dead man
of another crime?

00:15:25.007 --> 00:15:26.759
You wish to resurrect him, Christian?

00:15:26.843 --> 00:15:28.135
Crucify him once more?

00:15:28.219 --> 00:15:30.472
[Marco] He stole
and he was punished for it.

00:15:30.555 --> 00:15:33.182
{\an8}I did not sentence him...

00:15:33.265 --> 00:15:35.059
and I did not kill him, Goland.

00:15:35.142 --> 00:15:38.605
And my husband did not
send himself to Kochkor.

00:15:39.814 --> 00:15:41.691
But he did go?

00:15:43.275 --> 00:15:45.820
[Goland] He collected taxes.

00:15:45.903 --> 00:15:49.406
Every second fortnight, he rode.

00:15:49.491 --> 00:15:52.076
My husband was
an honorable man.

00:15:52.159 --> 00:15:54.621
Question the man
who sent Sanga to Kochkor

00:15:54.704 --> 00:15:56.706
before you question that.

00:16:05.339 --> 00:16:07.550
Leave us...

00:16:07.634 --> 00:16:09.426
please.

00:16:21.981 --> 00:16:26.318
[Chabi] We distribute 100,000
loaves of bread every month...

00:16:26.402 --> 00:16:30.406
goat milk and yak meat when
the Great Khan's herds are fat.

00:16:30.490 --> 00:16:34.243
[Khutulun] The people are fortunate
for your grace, My Lady.

00:16:34.326 --> 00:16:36.829
[Chabi]
We take care of our wards...

00:16:36.913 --> 00:16:40.291
and they revere the Khan
as their father.

00:16:40.374 --> 00:16:47.131
Today, they honor us by working tirelessly
to prepare for the White Moon festivities.

00:16:53.345 --> 00:16:55.472
Something wrong,
Blue Princess?

00:16:56.516 --> 00:16:59.060
I was merely observing
the peasants' devotion,

00:16:59.143 --> 00:17:01.646
their love for their
royal benefactress.

00:17:01.729 --> 00:17:05.066
Do you question
their devotion and their love?

00:17:05.149 --> 00:17:07.735
I do not.

00:17:07.819 --> 00:17:10.112
Stop.

00:17:13.365 --> 00:17:17.579
Does Lady Kokachin wish to speak
on the topic of the common people?

00:17:17.662 --> 00:17:20.748
I apologize, Empress,
for speaking when not bid to do so.

00:17:20.832 --> 00:17:23.793
Do so... now.

00:17:27.547 --> 00:17:30.800
Has Her Lady walked the villages
of Cambulac without her guard?

00:17:30.883 --> 00:17:32.426
I have not.

00:17:36.013 --> 00:17:39.726
The Empress' perception
of the city is tempered.

00:17:39.809 --> 00:17:44.438
The people love the Khan because
he eases their pains, fills their wants...

00:17:44.521 --> 00:17:49.068
but the cause of those pains and wants
is never permanently stamped out.

00:17:49.151 --> 00:17:51.070
That can breed resentment.

00:17:51.153 --> 00:17:55.867
Did you resolve such matters differently
when your family held power...

00:17:55.950 --> 00:17:58.327
Blue Princess of Bayaut?

00:17:58.410 --> 00:18:00.705
[breathes deeply]

00:18:00.788 --> 00:18:06.168
My relations with our people, Lady Chabi,
were somewhat more direct.

00:18:06.252 --> 00:18:08.129
Is that so?

00:18:10.757 --> 00:18:12.634
I mean no offense...

00:18:12.717 --> 00:18:14.886
but the Great Khan should
know the minds of his people

00:18:14.969 --> 00:18:17.930
before he walks
among them tomorrow.

00:18:18.014 --> 00:18:20.808
The Khagan has
my sword and my shield.

00:18:20.892 --> 00:18:24.103
I will meet minds
with metal, My Lady.

00:18:24.186 --> 00:18:26.981
The Great Khan is secure.

00:18:43.205 --> 00:18:45.833
Is the pain bad today, child?

00:18:49.503 --> 00:18:52.173
The child suffers, Chancellor.

00:18:54.091 --> 00:18:55.301
As do we all...

00:18:55.384 --> 00:18:58.805
but seeming cruelty
can bring beauty.

00:18:58.888 --> 00:19:01.808
Pain purifies
and leads to peace.

00:19:01.891 --> 00:19:04.560
These are lessons my sister
taught me when I was a boy.

00:19:04.644 --> 00:19:06.603
The girl is too old for binding.

00:19:06.688 --> 00:19:11.525
We would have started at an earlier age
were that her father's want.

00:19:11.608 --> 00:19:13.945
The Emperor's gone.

00:19:14.028 --> 00:19:16.948
I am her uncle.

00:19:17.031 --> 00:19:18.449
It is my want.

00:19:20.492 --> 00:19:23.996
'Tis a powerful man
who injures little children.

00:19:28.500 --> 00:19:31.587
I miss my mother.

00:19:34.048 --> 00:19:36.633
We all do, Sunflower...

00:19:36.718 --> 00:19:39.553
but I've arranged
to speed her journey.

00:19:39.636 --> 00:19:42.056
Now... look away, child.

00:19:43.891 --> 00:19:46.643
-[Ling Ling whimpering]
-[tightening bandages]

00:19:57.822 --> 00:20:00.449
Are you mad?

00:20:00.532 --> 00:20:03.870
Never contact me.
You will get us both killed.

00:20:07.498 --> 00:20:09.876
Out. Now.

00:20:12.128 --> 00:20:14.463
Why are you here?

00:20:15.882 --> 00:20:19.927
Jia Sidao took me into the palace...
after you left.

00:20:20.011 --> 00:20:21.220
He sent me.

00:20:23.890 --> 00:20:26.100
He has new orders, Mei Lin.

00:20:35.943 --> 00:20:39.030
I am to stay until
this mission is complete.

00:20:39.947 --> 00:20:42.283
Sidao offers this.

00:20:42.366 --> 00:20:43.826
Tiger root.

00:20:43.910 --> 00:20:47.329
Safe to the touch, but if ingested,
it's enough to fell a horse.

00:20:49.290 --> 00:20:51.417
This message says nothing of my daughter.

00:20:57.048 --> 00:20:58.674
Speak.

00:21:00.509 --> 00:21:02.053
He bound her.

00:21:11.145 --> 00:21:13.856
He will do worse if you fail.

00:21:13.940 --> 00:21:15.357
An assassination?

00:21:16.943 --> 00:21:19.946
What he asks of me
is impossible.

00:21:33.835 --> 00:21:36.003
[Ahmad] What else did you find
in Eagle's Teaching...

00:21:36.087 --> 00:21:37.964
besides impure gold?

00:21:38.047 --> 00:21:41.050
We found evidence that
Sanga hired the Hashshashin.

00:21:41.133 --> 00:21:43.344
He didn't choose to go.
He was sent.

00:21:44.345 --> 00:21:47.098
[Marco] We thought you might
offer guidance.

00:21:47.181 --> 00:21:49.558
Because he worked for me?

00:21:49.641 --> 00:21:51.768
Sanga worked for many.

00:21:51.853 --> 00:21:54.271
From Cambulac to...

00:21:54.355 --> 00:21:56.690
yes, Kochkor.

00:21:56.773 --> 00:21:59.068
The Hashshashin
deal in more than death...

00:21:59.151 --> 00:22:03.865
black market trade,
silk, coin, salt...

00:22:03.948 --> 00:22:06.492
and currencies
I do not countenance.

00:22:06.575 --> 00:22:08.369
Opium, hashish.

00:22:08.452 --> 00:22:10.704
You suspected
and did nothing?

00:22:10.787 --> 00:22:14.000
I cannot eliminate corruption...
and I will not condemn without proof.

00:22:14.083 --> 00:22:18.379
If Sanga were running black market goods
throughout the realm, he'd need agents...

00:22:18.462 --> 00:22:21.632
soldiers, horsemen...
imperial guard.

00:22:21.715 --> 00:22:24.010
You have seen my soldiers.

00:22:24.093 --> 00:22:25.928
They toil before the abacus.

00:22:26.012 --> 00:22:28.472
I certainly do not command
the imperial guard.

00:22:29.390 --> 00:22:32.226
That's Vice Regent Yusuf's domain.

00:22:37.439 --> 00:22:39.066
I simply state fact.

00:22:39.150 --> 00:22:41.152
Thank you, Ahmad.

00:22:42.819 --> 00:22:45.114
Why did you finally report Sanga?

00:22:45.197 --> 00:22:47.741
You reported
his transgressions to me.

00:22:47.824 --> 00:22:51.203
Had I not, it would have been
you or I unjustly trampled in the dirt.

00:23:00.129 --> 00:23:02.965
[Jia Sidao] How do preparations
for the boy's coronation fare?

00:23:03.049 --> 00:23:05.551
I trust seating arrangements
are managed?

00:23:05.634 --> 00:23:07.719
No awkward pairings?

00:23:08.304 --> 00:23:11.515
Lord Li cannot tolerate
Prelate Chan.

00:23:16.812 --> 00:23:18.897
[Empress Dowager]
Leave us, please...

00:23:18.981 --> 00:23:20.274
everyone.

00:23:33.370 --> 00:23:36.582
The Dynastic Council
has chosen to dismiss you, Sidao.

00:23:37.541 --> 00:23:39.876
We appreciate your service
to the Emperor...

00:23:39.961 --> 00:23:42.504
but it is time for you to step down.

00:23:47.176 --> 00:23:49.136
Have you anything to say?

00:23:49.220 --> 00:23:52.389
You have no authority.

00:23:52.473 --> 00:23:56.227
You are an old woman
with a dead husband and no power.

00:23:56.310 --> 00:23:58.562
You have nothing.

00:23:59.981 --> 00:24:01.440
[Empress Dowager]
I have a champion.

00:24:04.485 --> 00:24:07.321
Do you know Fang Zhen
of the Red Lotus Society?

00:24:07.404 --> 00:24:09.240
By reputation.

00:24:09.323 --> 00:24:10.574
A peasant farmer.

00:24:10.657 --> 00:24:13.702
A scholar-warrior
of the highest order...

00:24:13.785 --> 00:24:17.373
a Song dynasty loyalist...
a hero, Sidao.

00:24:17.456 --> 00:24:19.541
Because he was poor...

00:24:19.625 --> 00:24:21.418
a man of the people.

00:24:22.711 --> 00:24:24.921
He is not me.

00:24:26.423 --> 00:24:31.137
I shepherded this city, this empire
through a time of tumult...

00:24:31.220 --> 00:24:33.722
and that time has not passed.

00:24:33.805 --> 00:24:35.016
The Mongols will return.

00:24:35.099 --> 00:24:38.394
If they return,
they will settle terms of peace...

00:24:38.477 --> 00:24:40.812
and negotiate
those terms with him.

00:24:51.240 --> 00:24:55.827
Welcome... to the fortress...
Fang Zhen.

00:24:56.745 --> 00:24:58.622
Chancellor.

00:25:00.999 --> 00:25:02.918
Empress...

00:25:03.001 --> 00:25:05.421
I have been too long away.

00:25:10.801 --> 00:25:13.512
Take your pets
and your porcelain, Sidao...

00:25:13.595 --> 00:25:16.057
and return to the rice paddies.

00:25:31.738 --> 00:25:35.326
[praying in Arabic]

00:25:36.827 --> 00:25:38.162
[knocking on door]

00:25:39.413 --> 00:25:42.624
[speaking English] It is poor form
to disturb a man at prayer.

00:25:42.708 --> 00:25:47.421
[Byamba] We are here on the orders of
the Khan, Vice Regent... not your God.

00:25:48.797 --> 00:25:51.342
A serious matter.

00:25:53.552 --> 00:25:58.014
We apologize for the disturbance...
but the Khan has entrusted us.

00:25:59.808 --> 00:26:02.478
Do you remember Sanga,
the collector of taxes?

00:26:03.187 --> 00:26:06.064
He was executed
on your orders.

00:26:06.148 --> 00:26:09.235
My father and uncle
committed a similar crime.

00:26:09.318 --> 00:26:10.569
They were branded.

00:26:13.029 --> 00:26:15.616
My Khan favors you, Marco...

00:26:15.699 --> 00:26:18.619
thus spared your father and uncle.

00:26:18.702 --> 00:26:20.662
That was his choice, not mine.

00:26:20.746 --> 00:26:23.457
But the Khan had no hand
in Sanga's end.

00:26:23.540 --> 00:26:26.042
Respectfully,
death was your decree.

00:26:26.127 --> 00:26:29.546
You could have branded his palm,
severed his hand, taken an eye.

00:26:29.630 --> 00:26:31.590
I could do these things to you

00:26:31.673 --> 00:26:33.925
for challenging the dictates
of the Vice Regent.

00:26:35.219 --> 00:26:36.762
We think--

00:26:38.054 --> 00:26:41.183
We think Sanga was sent
to Eagle's Teaching...

00:26:41.267 --> 00:26:43.644
a proxy for a greater power...

00:26:43.727 --> 00:26:48.399
the agent who delivered instructions
for the murder of the Khan.

00:26:48.482 --> 00:26:52.110
And you suspect
Sanga was my proxy?

00:26:52.194 --> 00:26:55.781
In the absence of the Khan,
the Vice Regent would control Cambulac.

00:26:55.864 --> 00:27:00.076
This is true until the Kurultai
elected the next Khan of Khans.

00:27:01.370 --> 00:27:02.663
What motive have I, then?

00:27:02.746 --> 00:27:07.083
Vice Regent, we do not accuse.
We seek advice.

00:27:07.168 --> 00:27:08.669
The Great Lord trusts you.

00:27:08.752 --> 00:27:11.213
He does, Master Marco.

00:27:11.297 --> 00:27:13.799
I am trusted...

00:27:13.882 --> 00:27:15.551
because I lack ambition.

00:27:15.634 --> 00:27:20.597
I desire no... riches...
so I'm incorruptible.

00:27:21.890 --> 00:27:24.100
I have no blood claim to the throne,

00:27:24.185 --> 00:27:27.646
so there is nothing
to which I may ascend.

00:27:29.273 --> 00:27:32.150
I am a servant
who has but one function.

00:27:32.234 --> 00:27:33.485
Which is?

00:27:33.569 --> 00:27:36.822
I speak truth.

00:27:36.905 --> 00:27:40.576
It is this respect
I show my Khan.

00:27:41.493 --> 00:27:44.621
My days are driven
by this alone.

00:27:44.705 --> 00:27:48.166
"How do I best serve
Kublai and his kingdom?"

00:27:49.084 --> 00:27:53.922
There is...
clarity in service...

00:27:54.005 --> 00:27:57.968
but you... lack this.

00:28:01.555 --> 00:28:04.015
Yet here we are.

00:28:05.141 --> 00:28:07.143
Yet here we are.

00:28:10.146 --> 00:28:15.402
But with what true purpose...
does the Khan send you?

00:28:15.486 --> 00:28:18.447
How will you earn his trust?

00:28:20.031 --> 00:28:22.784
Think on that
as you take your leave.

00:28:25.246 --> 00:28:27.748
[praying in Arabic]

00:28:42.471 --> 00:28:45.641
Is my father safe?

00:28:45.724 --> 00:28:48.519
[Ahmad] Why ask me, Jingim?
Did you ask our father?

00:28:48.602 --> 00:28:50.854
[sighs] I did.

00:28:52.398 --> 00:28:54.190
He trusts Byamba.

00:28:54.275 --> 00:28:57.694
He trusts the Latin
and offers me silence.

00:28:57.778 --> 00:29:00.906
[Ahmad] Whatever they found in Kochkor
was of no consequence.

00:29:00.989 --> 00:29:02.699
He doesn't want to
burden you with trivialities.

00:29:02.783 --> 00:29:04.910
He doesn't trust me with the truth.

00:29:04.993 --> 00:29:07.120
And what would you
do with it, Jingim?

00:29:07.203 --> 00:29:11.583
What would you do
if you had a target for your rage?

00:29:12.501 --> 00:29:15.003
I would let my Mongol heart guide me.

00:29:15.086 --> 00:29:16.087
I would kill!

00:29:16.171 --> 00:29:18.715
The Great Khan knows this.

00:29:18.799 --> 00:29:20.426
If there is some truth
to hold from you,

00:29:20.509 --> 00:29:22.928
he does so because
he knows your heart.

00:29:24.346 --> 00:29:26.682
Let your father protect you.

00:29:27.683 --> 00:29:31.019
Let me, your brother, protect you...

00:29:31.102 --> 00:29:33.439
until we find a true target.

00:30:01.758 --> 00:30:02.926
Untrue by an inch.

00:30:03.009 --> 00:30:07.180
Untrue by an inch,
untrue by a mile.

00:30:07.263 --> 00:30:11.142
It is in the split moment when
all four hooves leave the ground.

00:30:11.226 --> 00:30:13.645
Breathe and send.

00:30:14.313 --> 00:30:18.149
When you first arrived,
you had too little yin, too much yang.

00:30:20.444 --> 00:30:24.781
And now, too much yin...
not enough...

00:30:30.537 --> 00:30:32.414
Not so simple.

00:30:32.498 --> 00:30:35.376
Do not strive for the center.

00:30:35.459 --> 00:30:40.589
Just breathe...
with your horse... and your arrow.

00:30:50.557 --> 00:30:52.225
[sighs]

00:30:53.477 --> 00:30:55.228
The Khan expects an answer.

00:30:55.311 --> 00:30:57.313
What answer to give?

00:30:57.398 --> 00:30:59.650
The cripple, Yusuf,
is beyond reproach.

00:30:59.733 --> 00:31:01.485
Yusuf hides behind his words.

00:31:01.568 --> 00:31:03.445
Is that what you'll report?

00:31:11.327 --> 00:31:14.247
Untrue by an inch...

00:31:14.330 --> 00:31:17.250
untrue by a mile.

00:31:36.227 --> 00:31:38.354
I have no story to tell, Sire.

00:31:38.439 --> 00:31:41.066
I believe my friend, Sanga,
traveled to Kochkor...

00:31:41.149 --> 00:31:43.819
but I do not know
on whose command... if anyone's.

00:31:43.902 --> 00:31:46.572
What are your suspicions?

00:31:48.073 --> 00:31:49.991
I must say nothing...

00:31:50.075 --> 00:31:53.078
for fear that I may
condemn an innocent.

00:31:54.705 --> 00:31:58.291
All I know...
is someone seeks your head.

00:31:58.374 --> 00:32:00.210
[scoffs]

00:32:00.293 --> 00:32:02.588
Many do, Latin.

00:32:04.590 --> 00:32:08.594
But my children have been
spared sight of me far too long.

00:32:09.803 --> 00:32:12.388
Take your leave.

00:32:12.473 --> 00:32:15.391
Your children want you alive, Sire.

00:32:27.278 --> 00:32:28.321
[door closes]

00:32:28.404 --> 00:32:31.032
Do you still suspect him?

00:32:35.078 --> 00:32:40.751
A weaker man would surrender a name
to deflect suspicion from himself.

00:32:40.834 --> 00:32:43.336
As would a man
burdened with guilt.

00:32:43.419 --> 00:32:46.131
I believe him to be neither.

00:32:46.214 --> 00:32:48.967
The boy has changed greatly
since coming to us.

00:32:49.050 --> 00:32:52.763
He did not come to us, Sire.
He was left...

00:32:52.846 --> 00:32:54.765
A fact that bears recall.

00:32:54.848 --> 00:32:56.141
[chuckles]

00:32:56.224 --> 00:32:59.102
You suspect the Latin's father?

00:33:00.145 --> 00:33:04.566
Did he abandon his son
to serve his purse... or his pope?

00:33:04.650 --> 00:33:07.193
So, what course of action tomorrow?

00:33:08.111 --> 00:33:11.865
We have detained and questioned
your guards and staff.

00:33:11.948 --> 00:33:14.743
I believe them innocent.

00:33:18.079 --> 00:33:21.041
My suspicion of Marco has waned...

00:33:21.124 --> 00:33:26.797
but for now, to be safe...
those whom lack your trust... kill.

00:33:28.882 --> 00:33:32.218
There would be few left living
if I heed that counsel.

00:33:33.469 --> 00:33:35.055
Should I trust you, Yusuf?

00:33:42.145 --> 00:33:43.564
Hmm?

00:33:45.481 --> 00:33:47.901
We will play another time.

00:34:02.457 --> 00:34:04.500
[indistinct conversations]

00:34:51.965 --> 00:34:53.549
[Byamba grunting]

00:35:02.183 --> 00:35:04.477
[Khutulun]
Where's your European playmate?

00:35:10.984 --> 00:35:13.569
He's an innocent
in this world, isn't he?

00:35:13.654 --> 00:35:15.155
And you and I are not?

00:35:15.238 --> 00:35:18.408
No... we are warriors.

00:35:20.285 --> 00:35:23.622
I fear our world strips him
of what innocence still remains.

00:35:26.708 --> 00:35:29.377
Then we do him a favor.

00:35:29.460 --> 00:35:32.923
The world is not kind to
the weak and the guileless.

00:35:36.927 --> 00:35:38.428
Would you like to wrestle me?

00:35:39.429 --> 00:35:42.974
There are no witnesses,
save Tengri.

00:35:43.058 --> 00:35:44.935
Do you think
you can beat me?

00:35:45.018 --> 00:35:46.728
I think you wish me to.

00:35:48.604 --> 00:35:49.898
Not today.

00:35:49.981 --> 00:35:51.191
Are you afraid?

00:35:51.733 --> 00:35:55.236
I simply hear the blade's song right now.

00:36:05.621 --> 00:36:06.873
[women giggling]

00:36:06.957 --> 00:36:07.999
[Kublai growling]

00:36:08.083 --> 00:36:10.251
Where you go?

00:36:18.551 --> 00:36:19.886
[Kublai growling]

00:36:19.970 --> 00:36:21.847
Where are you going?

00:37:07.683 --> 00:37:08.810
Come.

00:37:55.148 --> 00:37:57.650
If it pleases the Khan.

00:37:59.152 --> 00:38:01.362
[Kublai chuckling]

00:38:03.448 --> 00:38:05.992
If it pleases the Queen.
Hmm?

00:38:14.542 --> 00:38:17.462
[whispers] It does not
please the Queen.

00:38:31.392 --> 00:38:33.228
[women sobbing]

00:38:39.985 --> 00:38:43.696
[Ahmad] Pitiable event
on this blessed day of <i>Tsagaan Sar.</i>

00:39:00.755 --> 00:39:02.548
[inhaling]

00:39:05.426 --> 00:39:08.513
It seems life has left her too soon.

00:39:14.602 --> 00:39:17.605
The Khan's consorts must not cry.

00:39:19.900 --> 00:39:22.235
It clouds the eyes
and ruddies the complexion.

00:39:22.318 --> 00:39:23.403
Death is life.

00:39:23.486 --> 00:39:26.447
Now is not the time for tears.

00:39:37.333 --> 00:39:40.170
[Fang Zhen] Will you return to
your village, Chancellor?

00:39:40.253 --> 00:39:42.380
[Jia Sidao] I was too grand for it
when I was part of it.

00:39:42.463 --> 00:39:45.133
I've grown grander since.

00:39:45.216 --> 00:39:47.635
I have been an admirer of yours...

00:39:47.718 --> 00:39:51.097
from afar... from the battlefield.

00:39:51.181 --> 00:39:55.435
You have been an annoying thorn in
Kublai's side for many years, Fang Zhen,

00:39:55.518 --> 00:39:58.939
frightening his tax collectors,
burning his crops,

00:39:59.022 --> 00:40:01.107
storing weapons
in loyalist settlements,

00:40:01.191 --> 00:40:03.944
settlements that bear the brunt
of the Khan's brutality

00:40:04.027 --> 00:40:05.361
after you've moved on.

00:40:06.279 --> 00:40:08.448
I've long admired you as well.

00:40:09.074 --> 00:40:10.616
I tire of warfare.

00:40:10.700 --> 00:40:13.995
Before or after Empress Dowager
offered you my title?

00:40:14.495 --> 00:40:18.291
War is pointless.
It never ends.

00:40:18.374 --> 00:40:22.087
Yes... the warrior
who rejects war.

00:40:23.254 --> 00:40:25.215
Empress is more intelligent
than I suspected.

00:40:25.298 --> 00:40:26.716
You... more foolish.

00:40:26.799 --> 00:40:32.347
We are like-minded, Chancellor...
in our need to defend Xiangyang.

00:40:32.430 --> 00:40:35.433
I will do so until my final breath.

00:40:35.516 --> 00:40:37.727
Peace is possible...

00:40:37.810 --> 00:40:42.315
and it begins, Jia Sidao...
with our peaceful transition.

00:40:52.867 --> 00:40:54.452
[Kublai grunts]

00:40:57.913 --> 00:41:00.333
Is it time?

00:41:00.416 --> 00:41:02.252
It is, Father...

00:41:06.464 --> 00:41:09.842
but I did not advise
your attendance.

00:41:09.925 --> 00:41:13.554
What can be done
has been done, Jingim.

00:41:15.015 --> 00:41:17.225
You worry like your mother.

00:41:17.308 --> 00:41:19.894
Vice Regent Yusuf himself
concurs with me.

00:41:21.812 --> 00:41:25.275
Yusuf is worse than your mother.

00:41:25.358 --> 00:41:29.279
We do not yet know
who conspired against Your Greatness.

00:41:29.362 --> 00:41:32.073
Rumor breeds fear.

00:41:32.157 --> 00:41:36.202
My people do not know if
blood courses through my veins...

00:41:36.286 --> 00:41:40.873
or if my body rests with Genghis
in Burkhan Khaldun.

00:41:43.751 --> 00:41:45.795
I must show them their Khan.

00:41:46.879 --> 00:41:49.590
You are concerned
you are seen as weak.

00:41:50.591 --> 00:41:51.926
Mmm.

00:41:57.265 --> 00:42:00.643
I cannot afford to
bolster these perceptions.

00:42:00.726 --> 00:42:03.354
There is no question, Father.

00:42:03.438 --> 00:42:06.191
You slayed Ariq single-handedly.

00:42:07.483 --> 00:42:10.528
Why was that necessary?

00:42:10.611 --> 00:42:12.947
Why did my brother challenge me?

00:42:14.782 --> 00:42:17.785
He saw me as weak.

00:42:17.868 --> 00:42:21.706
Despite what I did...
people still...

00:42:21.789 --> 00:42:25.000
rumor of my decline...

00:42:25.085 --> 00:42:26.752
and they worry for succession.

00:42:26.836 --> 00:42:30.798
-The line is clear.
-But not guaranteed, Jingim.

00:42:32.425 --> 00:42:37.180
You will be opposed at the Kurultai
when the time comes.

00:42:37.263 --> 00:42:40.933
Kaidu... Nayan...

00:42:41.016 --> 00:42:43.519
many feel entitled to my throne.

00:42:43.603 --> 00:42:46.481
The throne is mine
and I will ascend to it.

00:42:46.564 --> 00:42:49.234
There is nothing I desire
more than this.

00:42:50.818 --> 00:42:52.737
But you fear I will fail.

00:42:52.820 --> 00:42:55.740
You must prove yourself
to the Khanate.

00:42:55.823 --> 00:42:59.660
Until you do...
until you silence all doubters...

00:42:59.744 --> 00:43:01.036
I must be strong.

00:43:04.499 --> 00:43:06.959
And so today...
you risk yourself?

00:43:10.130 --> 00:43:12.465
I fulfill my duty.

00:43:14.509 --> 00:43:17.387
Rally my people.

00:43:19.555 --> 00:43:22.558
To inspire your strength.

00:43:24.519 --> 00:43:26.229
Am I such a burden?

00:43:30.358 --> 00:43:31.942
You're my son.

00:43:47.667 --> 00:43:52.463
[children laughing]

00:43:56.759 --> 00:43:58.928
Tulga...

00:43:59.011 --> 00:44:01.264
I spoke to Kokachin.

00:44:01.347 --> 00:44:04.184
I did not come to hurt you.
I came to help you.

00:44:04.850 --> 00:44:06.394
You lie.

00:44:06.477 --> 00:44:07.937
I know who you are.

00:44:08.020 --> 00:44:12.442
One of the Bayaut...
a survivor of the massacre.

00:44:14.735 --> 00:44:15.903
I know she protects you.

00:44:15.986 --> 00:44:17.738
I protect her.

00:44:17.822 --> 00:44:19.532
No more.

00:44:19.615 --> 00:44:22.243
If I found you,
someone else will find you.

00:44:22.327 --> 00:44:24.912
It will be your undoing and hers.

00:44:24.995 --> 00:44:26.289
You risk the Princess.

00:44:26.372 --> 00:44:28.082
The Princess is all I have.

00:44:30.626 --> 00:44:31.711
You love her.

00:44:31.794 --> 00:44:34.547
There was an arrangement... long ago.

00:44:34.630 --> 00:44:36.048
We are to be together.

00:44:43.764 --> 00:44:46.726
I will bring you the stones.
You will not see Kokachin.

00:44:48.936 --> 00:44:51.231
But you will live.

00:44:55.150 --> 00:44:57.820
-[drumming]
-[villagers chanting]

00:45:02.074 --> 00:45:05.786
[Jingim] All bow down
and worship at once your Lord.

00:45:07.663 --> 00:45:12.293
God save and keep our Lord long
with joy and gladness.

00:45:13.961 --> 00:45:17.089
Long live the Khan of Khans!

00:45:19.133 --> 00:45:21.677
[drumroll]

00:45:56.796 --> 00:45:58.964
Urla.

00:45:59.048 --> 00:46:02.843
No line up for water
on the night of the White Moon.

00:46:05.721 --> 00:46:08.558
I'm sorry for what happened
to your father.

00:46:10.518 --> 00:46:13.646
As you said,
you did not sentence him...

00:46:13.729 --> 00:46:16.441
and if he was a thief,
he was deserving of punishment.

00:46:17.358 --> 00:46:19.151
Sanga was a good man.

00:46:20.069 --> 00:46:22.947
What do you think he did?

00:46:23.030 --> 00:46:25.366
What was it
Ahmad sent him to do?

00:46:25.450 --> 00:46:26.909
I cannot answer that.

00:46:26.992 --> 00:46:29.495
Never again breathe that suspicion.

00:46:29.579 --> 00:46:33.499
For your family's sake... never.

00:46:39.880 --> 00:46:41.799
Move on.

00:46:41.882 --> 00:46:45.135
Help your family
to find a future without him.

00:46:54.645 --> 00:46:56.313
[rhythmic drumming]

00:47:17.377 --> 00:47:19.712
The bracelet is delivered.

00:47:21.672 --> 00:47:23.674
I am most grateful.

00:47:23.758 --> 00:47:25.718
I will repay your gesture
in the future.

00:47:25.801 --> 00:47:29.972
You can repay it now...
with the answer to a question.

00:47:30.055 --> 00:47:32.975
How is it that a peasant
weds a princess?

00:47:36.979 --> 00:47:40.107
No royal marries
beneath their station.

00:47:40.190 --> 00:47:43.027
Then Tulga is delusional?

00:47:44.695 --> 00:47:48.658
I could not be with Tulga, Master Marco,
any more than I could be with you.

00:47:48.741 --> 00:47:51.661
You avoid a direct answer
to my question, Blue Princess.

00:47:55.956 --> 00:47:58.501
Silence is no shield, Kokachin.

00:47:58.584 --> 00:48:00.961
If you expect me to deliver
the gems to your subject,

00:48:01.045 --> 00:48:03.380
I need to know
if that subject is mad.

00:48:07.301 --> 00:48:09.303
He is not.

00:48:11.597 --> 00:48:13.891
Then there are nuptials
to be arranged.

00:48:13.974 --> 00:48:15.435
Is the Khan aware?

00:48:17.645 --> 00:48:19.063
You lack humor, Latin.

00:48:19.146 --> 00:48:21.065
I intend none.

00:48:22.442 --> 00:48:24.193
I am deceived.

00:48:30.450 --> 00:48:35.496
It is time for Jingim
to take a new wife, I think.

00:48:35.580 --> 00:48:38.583
A more fertile bitch, I hope.

00:48:38.666 --> 00:48:42.086
-The rest are barren as my Gobi.
-[chuckles]

00:48:42.169 --> 00:48:45.590
I trust you have
someone in mind?

00:48:48.050 --> 00:48:49.969
[people cheering]

00:49:56.744 --> 00:49:58.746
Stop!

00:49:59.789 --> 00:50:01.248
[people exclaiming]

00:50:10.049 --> 00:50:11.759
[choking]

00:50:13.427 --> 00:50:15.429
[people screaming]

00:50:37.993 --> 00:50:39.161
[soldier grunting]

00:51:08.065 --> 00:51:10.025
[gasping]

00:51:10.109 --> 00:51:11.986
[soldiers shouting]

00:51:18.242 --> 00:51:19.451
[grunts]

00:51:19.534 --> 00:51:22.037
[wailing]

00:51:37.052 --> 00:51:39.596
[theme music playing]